    "markdown": "See also [Home](/#/pages/df9ddfd9-4481-2ee7-d372-27a094ad4728) and [Release process](/#/pages/1e23f551-b228-b2f5-7e40-8e889d58ee1f). Relative link: [Runbook](/#/pages/5faceeac-909d-06c7-382b-75c5249948ff) and [Runbook section](/#/pages/5faceeac-909d-06c7-382b-75c5249948ff?heading=import-09a77bb588b2bd1103613b38), same-page [jump](/#/pages/c17a4799-8071-6e1c-cf56-437239a3d223?heading=import-74ecb1016891273e3f4959ca).\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> Deployments are frozen on Fridays.\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> Never deploy without a backup.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- [x] Access to the cluster\n\n- [ ] VPN configured\n\n  - [ ] nested task\n\n- Plain bullet with ~~strikethrough~~ and **bold *nested italic*** and `inline code`\n\n1. First\n2. Second\n   1. Nested ordered\n3. Third\n\n| Service | Port | Owner |\n| :--- | ---: | :---: |\n| api | 8080 | @team |\n| worker | — | ops |\n\n### Architecture\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  A[Client] --> B[API]\n```\n\nInline math $E = mc^2$ and block math:\n\n$$\n\\sum_{i=1}^n i = \\frac{n(n+1)}{2}\n$$\n\n#### Rollback\n\nBare URL <https://example.com/docs> and autolink <https://example.org>. Footnote reference[\\[1\\]](/#/pages/c17a4799-8071-6e1c-cf56-437239a3d223?heading=import-1a72b432d5014021b38b386e). Emoji \uD83D\uDE80.\n\n![Architecture diagram](/api/attachments/bcb3c293-ad2f-36bb-bb0d-b4a3b5b3b571/content)\n\n##### Advanced options\n\nHidden **content** here.\n\nLine one\\\nline two\\\nhard break above.\n\n```bash\nkubectl rollout undo deployment/api\n```\n\n## Poznámky pod čarou\n\n1. The footnote text. [↩](/#/pages/c17a4799-8071-6e1c-cf56-437239a3d223?heading=import-74ecb1016891273e3f4959ca)",
